Subject: rpcrt4: implement NdrStubCall3 for the DCE syntax

Windows 7 x64's actxprxy.dll and propsys.dll stubs call NdrStubCall3. As a
spec stub it ended w7-explorer ("unimplemented function") when a
double-clicked desktop icon such as the Recycle Bin was opened, so the
screen blinked and the shell restarted. Thor addition on top of win4wine's
series.

